              "message": "README: the goals, the concepts, the install lines and the links\n\nThe README had grown to four hundred lines: three install paths, the\ntour's clip and its code in two languages, the analyser's report and\ntwo status lists. It now keeps what a first visit needs: what CHAP is\nfor, the concepts, one line each to install it, the override envelope,\nthe status and where to read on.\n\nThe rest moved where it is read. docs/tour.md takes the 90-second tour:\nthe clip, the code for each step in TypeScript and Python, and the\nanalyser's report. ABOUT.md takes what the override envelope's fields\npoint at, and reading the log back. START_HERE.md names the libraries,\nthe templates and the profile explorer among its ways in, and\nIN_PRACTICE.md links the tour's page. The 0.3.4 changelog entry gains a\nDocumentation line, since this goes out with the release.",
